title Communication Diagram: Presensi Kehadiran dan Rekapitulasi Otomatis (KF-06, KF-07)

actor "Anggota" as Member
actor "Admin/Pengurus" as Admin
rectangle "<u>:Kegiatan</u>" as K
rectangle "<u>:Presensi</u>" as Pr
rectangle "<u>:RekapKehadiran</u>" as Rk

Member --> Pr : 1: presensiMandiri()
Pr --> K : 1.1: sedangBerlangsung()
Pr --> Pr : 1.2 [kegiatan berlangsung], 2.1, 3.1: cekPresensiGanda()
Pr --> Rk : 1.3 [belum presensi]: <<include>> perbaruiRekap()
Rk --> Rk : 1.3.1: hitungPersentase()
Pr ..> Member : 1.4 [belum presensi]: konfirmasi presensi\nberhasil beserta timestamp
Pr ..> Member : 1.5 [sudah presensi]: peringatan\nPresensi sudah tercatat
Pr ..> Member : 1.6 [di luar jadwal]: sesi presensi\nbelum dibuka atau telah berakhir
Admin --> Pr : 2: catatPresensi()
Pr --> Rk : 2.2: <<include>> perbaruiRekap()
Pr ..> Admin : 2.3: konfirmasi presensi tercatat
Admin --> Pr : 3: koreksiPresensi(status)
Pr --> Rk : 3.2: <<include>> perbaruiRekap()
Pr ..> Admin : 3.3: konfirmasi koreksi tersimpan
Admin --> Rk : 4: lihatRekapPerKegiatan()
Rk ..> Admin : 4.1: rekap dan persentase kehadiran per kegiatan
Admin --> Rk : 5: lihatRekapPerPeriode(awal, akhir)
Rk ..> Admin : 5.1: rekap dan persentase kehadiran per periode

@enduml

